WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.301
-I was at a Prince show once.

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:03.369
Couldn't stay in my -- Remember
that time we saw Prince?

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:06.305 line:0%
-Yes, I do.
-At that party.

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:09.575
And I sat right on the stage
and watched him.

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:12.011
-Are you talking about
the after party

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:13.913
where you got Prince to perform?

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.349
-Well, I think me and you
got him to perform.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:17.984
-Yeah, but that was --
-Really, it was you.

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:20.253
-Yeah, we were
at the "SNL" after party,

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.888
and everyone
I could ask for a favor

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:24.157
did me a favor and got onstage.

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:25.891
It was awesome.
Everyone was so nice.

00:00:25.891 --> 00:00:28.928
And we had everybody you
could think of getting onstage.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.196
Elvis Costello, Blondie.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.664
-Maya Rudolph was there.

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:34.266
-Taylor Swift, Ariana Grande,
Miley Cyrus.

00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:35.969
They all got up --
Paul McCartney.

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:37.837
Everyone was up,
singing, doing --

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.006
It was really, honestly
like you wouldn't even believe.

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:42.541
-Didn't, like,
the B-52's go on, too?

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:45.779
-Absolutely. B-52's came on,
and I go,

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:46.780
"What do you want to sing?"

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.247
And he goes, "'Love Shack.'"

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:50.416
I go, "Yeah, but do you want to
do, like, 'Mustang Sally'?"

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:52.117
He goes, "'Love Shack'!"

00:00:52.117 --> 00:00:54.353
"Alright, dude. Alright."

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:55.388
So, I go to the band --
And the band --

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:56.556
We didn't have a real band.

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:57.823
The band was trying to
figure out "Love Shack."

00:00:57.823 --> 00:01:00.226
Like, I don't even know what --

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.994
What note is that where
you start "Love Shack"?

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:03.563
♪ See a faded sign ♪

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:04.564
What is that?
-Oh, well...

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.966
-Wait. Do that again, Jimmy.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.902
-♪ See at the side of the road ♪

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:12.172
♪ It says "15 miles to the..." ♪

00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:15.341
♪ Old shack shimmy ♪

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:18.410
♪ Old shack shimmy ♪

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:23.049
So, everyone's getting onstage,
and then I see you.

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:24.217
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:26.686
I see you and I go,
"Dave, what can I do?

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:27.720
What do I do?"

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.656
And you go, "Dude, I think --

00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:32.625
Prince is here, and I think
if you asked him the right way,

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.126
he would come up
and do something.

00:01:34.126 --> 00:01:37.129
I go, "Prince? Is Prince here?

00:01:37.129 --> 00:01:39.299
I'd love it if you came up
and sang something."

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.935
And then everything just
kind of parted.

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:46.005
And then there was like a fog --
Like, a smoke machine came on.

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:47.873
Someone had a portable
smoke machine or something.

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:50.843
And he kind of floated,
like his legs weren't touching.

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:54.380 line:0%
It was like he kind of
just went like -- like, floated.

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.849 line:0%
Like, his legs --
And he had boots on

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:58.785 line:0%
and he just kind of
floated to the stage.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.520
And he came up,
and I go, "Oh, my gosh."

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:03.589
And he came up and
he took these long gloves off.

00:02:03.589 --> 00:02:06.191
And gave me the gloves,
and I go, "Thank you so much."

00:02:06.191 --> 00:02:08.227
And someone threw him a guitar.

00:02:08.227 --> 00:02:10.463
He caught the guitar
and he got up

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:12.832
and he sang "Let's Go Crazy."

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:14.333
He sang "Let's Go Crazy."
-Yes, he did.

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:17.470
-And, dude, it was one of
the best things

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.605
I've ever seen in my entire --

00:02:19.605 --> 00:02:21.540
or been around
in my entire life.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.409
It just --
Everyone was going nuts.

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:25.678
I remember Jay-Z and Beyoncé
were in the crowd.

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.947
We're like, "Wow!
Didn't see that coming."

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:31.284
Yeah, they were like, "Well --"
It was giant, man.

00:02:31.284 --> 00:02:32.552
But thanks again for doing that.

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:34.820
You were a major role
in getting him to do that.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.355
That was a big night.

00:02:36.355 --> 00:02:37.924
-Oh, man that was amazing.

